usage: macos_preview.py [-h] [--rotation {0,180}] [--seconds SECONDS]
                        [--fps FPS]

Live C5 preview on macOS; only fixed keyframe request/cancel commands. Usage:
./start_preview.command [--rotation 0|180] [--seconds 15] Q / Esc / closing
the player window stops capture and releases the device.

options:
  -h, --help          show this help message and exit
  --rotation {0,180}  Display rotation only; default 0; select 180 only for an
                      inverted camera
  --seconds SECONDS   0 runs until the window is closed
  --fps FPS           Nominal playback rate for the untimestamped HEVC stream
